    <briefdescription>
<para>Represents a single face rotation move on the Rubik&apos;s Cube. </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>A move consists of:<itemizedlist>
<listitem><para>face: which face to rotate (0..5)</para>
</listitem><listitem><para>rev: whether rotation is counter-clockwise (90 degrees CCW)</para>
</listitem><listitem><para>is180: whether rotation is a double turn (180 degrees)</para>
</listitem></itemizedlist>
</para>
<para>Moves are intended to be immutable after creation. </para>
    </detaileddescription>
